            "<p>Dominant</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Wrinkled seed (r)</p>",
            "<p>Recessive</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ay4qtnh",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "8. Genotype & Phenotype"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rzf2pgy",
      "content": "Genotype refers to the genetic constitution (TT, Tt, tt), whereas phenotype refers to observable characters."
    },
    {
      "id": "q18d0ng",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Chromosomes"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "v41uc5v",
      "content": "Chromosomes are thread-like structures present in nucleus. Humans have 23 pairs (46 chromosomes): 22 pairs of autosomes and 1 pair of sex chromosomes."
    },
    {
      "id": "wlchf0t",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Type</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Number in Humans</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Autosomes</p>",
            "<p>22 pairs</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Sex Chromosomes</p>",
            "<p>1 pair (XX/XY)</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cvo3muw",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10. Sex Determination in Humans"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9d1fuyj",
      "content": "Females have XX chromosomes while males have XY chromosomes. The sperm determines the sex of the child."
    },
    {
      "id": "ybgqwe3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "11. Blood Group Inheritance"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ylufjd5",
      "content": "ABO blood group system is controlled by three alleles: IA, IB and i. IA and IB are codominant, while i is recessi<strong>ve. </strong>"
    },
    {
